              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch2 class=\u0022govuk-heading-m\u0022\u003EChange the number of pages\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis example displays 10 items per page. The pagination style changes when there are more than 10 pages.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
